msgstr "![\"Output of the previous code cell\"](/learning/images/courses/quantum-machine-learning/data-encoding/checkin4.avif)\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Using angle encoding as described above, how many qubits are required to encode 5 features?\n"
msgstr "Menggunakan pengekodan sudut seperti yang diterangkan di atas, berapa banyak qubit yang diperlukan untuk mengekodkan 5 ciri?\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
