# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dense angle encoding {#dense-angle-encoding}"
msgstr "Pengekodan sudut padat {#dense-angle-encoding}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Dense angle encoding (DAE) is a combination of angle encoding and phase encoding. DAE allows two feature values to be encoded in a single qubit: one angle with a Y-axis rotation angle, and the other with a $z$-axis rotation angle: $\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k,$ $\\vec{x}^{(j)}_\\ell \\rightarrow \\theta, \\phi$. It encodes two features as follows:\n"
msgstr "Pengekodan sudut padat (DAE) adalah gabungan pengekodan sudut dan pengekodan fasa. DAE membolehkan dua nilai ciri dikodkan dalam satu qubit tunggal: satu sudut dengan sudut putaran paksi-Y, dan satu lagi dengan sudut putaran paksi-$z$: $\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k,$ $\\vec{x}^{(j)}_\\ell \\rightarrow \\theta, \\phi$. Ia mengekodkan dua ciri seperti berikut:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k,\\vec{x}^{(j)}_\\ell\\rangle = R_Z(\\phi=\\vec{x}^{(j)}_\\ell) R_Y(\\theta=\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k)|0\\rangle = \\cos\\left(\\frac{\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k}{2}\\right)|0\\rangle + e^{i\\vec{x}^{(j)}_\\ell} \\sin\\left(\\frac{\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k}{2}\\right)|1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k,\\vec{x}^{(j)}_\\ell\\rangle = R_Z(\\phi=\\vec{x}^{(j)}_\\ell) R_Y(\\theta=\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k)|0\\rangle = \\cos\\left(\\frac{\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k}{2}\\right)|0\\rangle + e^{i\\vec{x}^{(j)}_\\ell} \\sin\\left(\\frac{\\vec{x}^{(j)}_k}{2}\\right)|1\\rangle.\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Encoding two data features to one qubit results in a $2\\times$ reduction in the number of qubits required for the encoding. Extending this to more features, the data vector $\\vec{x} = (x_1,...,x_N)$ can be encoded as:\n"
msgstr "Pengekodan dua ciri data ke satu qubit menghasilkan pengurangan $2\\times$ dalam bilangan qubit yang diperlukan untuk pengekodan. Dengan memperluaskan ini kepada lebih banyak ciri, vektor data $\\vec{x} = (x_1,...,x_N)$ boleh dikodkan sebagai:\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"$$\n"
"|\\vec{x}\\rangle = \\bigotimes_{k=1}^{N/2} \\cos(x_{2k-1})|0\\rangle + e^{i x_{2k}}\\sin(x_{2k-1})|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"
msgstr ""
"$$\n"
"|\\vec{x}\\rangle = \\bigotimes_{k=1}^{N/2} \\cos(x_{2k-1})|0\\rangle + e^{i x_{2k}}\\sin(x_{2k-1})|1\\rangle\n"
"$$\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "DAE can be generalized to arbitrary functions of the two features instead of the sinusoidal functions used here. This is called general qubit encoding[\\[7\\]](#references).\n"
msgstr "DAE boleh digeneralisasikan kepada fungsi sewenang-wenang bagi dua ciri tersebut daripada fungsi sinusoid yang digunakan di sini. Ini dipanggil pengekodan qubit umum[\\[7\\]](#references).\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As an example of DAE, the code below encodes and visualizes the encoding of the features $x_1=\\theta = 3\\pi/8$ and $x_2=\\phi = 7\\pi/4$.\n"
msgstr "Sebagai contoh DAE, kod di bawah mengekodkan dan menggambarkan pengekodan ciri $x_1=\\theta = 3\\pi/8$ dan $x_2=\\phi = 7\\pi/4$.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/quantum-machine-learning/data-encoding/extracted-outputs/9a6bb041-d7a1-4e29-a463-81b93b900e96-0.avif)\n"
msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/quantum-machine-learning/data-encoding/extracted-outputs/9a6bb041-d7a1-4e29-a463-81b93b900e96-0.avif)\n"

